GenericInitialIdeal -- find the generic initial ideal of a given ideal
**********************************************************************

Description
===========

GenericInitialIdeal is a package for computing generic initial ideals of ideals
in a polynomial ring, that is, the monomial ideal of lead terms after a random
change of coordinates.  All of these routines are probabilistic: with high
probability, they give the correct answer, but it could be the case that the
choice of coordinates is too special.

